WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,880
What do you want to do?

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,520
No. 1 on the freshman list

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,530
Should I treat you to a treat? If one meal is not enough, five meals will be enough for you.

4
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:18,810
You are too strong

5
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:22,160
The crime will definitely be honored. I have to go out now.

6
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:33,790
Do you believe it or not?

7
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:39,590
We must work hard in the future, otherwise the distance between us and Lin Mo will become further and further away. Who would have thought of brothers who share the same dormitory?

8
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:40,790
Directly reach the top of the freshman list

9
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,710
The monthly stipend of 3 million yuan is also free for schools

10
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,790
Craftsmanship top longevity grain

11
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,750
My sense of superiority as a rich second generation is completely gone.

12
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:49,010
It turns out that this is what you said you were working hard for.
